    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        274,
        1887,
        1853,
        2240
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In order to realize the objectives of this vast school construction program and to meet as rapidly as possible the urgent needs of our school system, interested agencies are instructed to give careful consideration to planning and personnel. I expect the fullest cooperation and coordination of all agencies and departments concerned with school construction to insure effective implementation of this program.",
